", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-videohelpersuite", "ver": "a7ce59e381934733bfae03b1be029756d6ce936d", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VHS_VideoInfo"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#d8771c", "widgets_values": ["## 🥒mode（模式）：\n\ntiny → 更快（默认）；full→ 更高的质量\n\n## 🥒比例（放大倍数）：\n通常使用4效果更好；如果明显存在不足，可使用2\n\n## 🥒color_fix（颜色修改）：\n使用小波变换方法修改输出视频的颜色偏差。\n\n## 🥒tiled_vae（VAE分块解码）：\n启用后可显着降低显着的存储占用，但会降低解码速度。\n\n## 🥒tiled_dit（DiT分块计算）：\n大幅减少显着的占用占用，但会降低推理速度。\n\n## 🥒tile_size /tile_overlap（分块大小与重叠）：\n控制输入视频在推理时的分块方式。\n\n## 🥒unload_dit（卸载DiT模型）：\n解码前卸载DiT模型以降低速度显着存高，但会小幅降低。\n\n## 🥒local_range(上下文参考)\nlocal_range 值越大： 模型需要同时处理更多的视频帧数据。这意味着更高的计算成本、更大的显存占用和更长的处理时间。\nlocal_range 值越小： 模型处理的帧数较少，因此计算速度会更快，显存占用更低。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用说明：", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#a25915", "size": [367.8783874511719, 532.35888671875], "pos": [-1206.3143310546875, 603.7730102539062], "id": 11, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [24, 33], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "frame_count", "label": "帧计数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "frame_count"}, {"name": "audio", "links": [12, 23], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "video_info", "links": [13], "label": "视频信息", "type": "VHS_VIDEOINFO", "localized_name": "video_info"}], "color": "#4a7b4a", "widgets_values": {"custom_height": 0, "force_rate": 16, "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 0, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"custom_height": 0, "filename": "eddec00c960816a04f22468f4969621f385a495b2c1c0a04cfc4bbb84e3bf792.mp4", "force_rate": 16, "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 0, "format": "vi